{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 3, "text": "（四）智力类娱乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 330, "w": 306, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（四）智力类娱乐", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 330, "w": 306, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 4, "text": "有下母猪棋、下草秆棋等。是青少年喜欢的智力娱乐。", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 394, "w": 945, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有下母猪棋、下草秆棋等。是青少年喜欢的智力娱乐。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 394, "w": 945, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 5, "text": "母猪棋。在地上或石板上画上棋格，两人对阵。棋格有一称为“猪窝”的主格，一方", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 455, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "母猪棋。在地上或石板上画上棋格，两人对阵。棋格有一称为“猪窝”的主格，一方", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 455, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 6, "text": "有一块小石板称为母猪，12颗小石子称为猪仔。下时似跳棋，猪仔按规定线格互相进攻", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "有一块小石板称为母猪，12颗小石子称为猪仔。下时似跳棋，猪仔按规定线格互相进攻", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 519, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 7, "text": "阻拦，设法将对方猪仔拦到己方母猪辖格，将其捡来让母猪护住，最后看谁的母猪将全部", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 583, "w": 1548, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "阻拦，设法将对方猪仔拦到己方母猪辖格，将其捡来让母猪护住，最后看谁的母猪将全部", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 583, "w": 1548, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 8, "text": "猪仔提住，以此定胜负。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 652, "w": 414, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "猪仔提住，以此定胜负。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 652, "w": 414, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 9, "text": "草秆棋。在地上画棋格，每次12根草秆，一根比一根短些，草秆各按规定线格跳下，", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 716, "w": 1463, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "草秆棋。在地上画棋格，每次12根草秆，一根比一根短些，草秆各按规定线格跳下，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 716, "w": 1463, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 10, "text": "长秆吃短秆，最短又吃最长的，最后草秆先被吃完者为败。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 781, "w": 1001, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "长秆吃短秆，最短又吃最长的，最后草秆先被吃完者为败。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 781, "w": 1001, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 11, "text": "（五）竞技类娱乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 849, "w": 306, "h": 40}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（五）竞技类娱乐", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 849, "w": 306, "h": 40}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 12, "text": "包括踩高跷、翻叠桌、走绳、爬圈竿等。这些娱乐活动由专门艺人表演。一般是有耍", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 905, "w": 1467, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "包括踩高跷、翻叠桌、走绳、爬圈竿等。这些娱乐活动由专门艺人表演。一般是有耍", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 905, "w": 1467, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 13, "text": "龙传统的村寨才培养这些艺人。每年耍龙的正月十三至十五演出，艺人业余，演出只", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 974, "w": 1544, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "龙传统的村寨才培养这些艺人。每年耍龙的正月十三至十五演出，艺人业余，演出只", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 974, "w": 1544, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 14, "text": "供娱乐，不向主事者和观众索取报酬。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1034, "w": 663, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "供娱乐，不向主事者和观众索取报酬。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1034, "w": 663, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 15, "text": "踩高跷和走绳。属于杂技类娱乐活动，技术难度较高，比如掌握身体重心平衡，等", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1102, "w": 1467, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "踩高跷和走绳。属于杂技类娱乐活动，技术难度较高，比如掌握身体重心平衡，等", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 1102, "w": 1467, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 16, "text": "等，需要由掌握此项技能的师傅传授，同时学习和表演者需要有一定天赋。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1163, "w": 1295, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "等，需要由掌握此项技能的师傅传授，同时学习和表演者需要有一定天赋。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1163, "w": 1295, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 17, "text": "翻叠桌。12张八仙桌相叠于院场中，最后一张脚朝天，2名艺人在朝天四脚上翻跟", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1235, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "翻叠桌。12张八仙桌相叠于院场中，最后一张脚朝天，2名艺人在朝天四脚上翻跟", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1235, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 18, "text": "斗、倒立等，表演出各种技巧。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1300, "w": 515, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "斗、倒立等，表演出各种技巧。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1300, "w": 515, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 19, "text": "爬圈竿。立一木竿，高丈五，上系一横竿，横竿悬上8个尺余直径的连环，表演者在", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1364, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "爬圈竿。立一木竿，高丈五，上系一横竿，横竿悬上8个尺余直径的连环，表演者在", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1364, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 20, "text": "连环上上下做各种技巧。另一种竞技娱乐被称为“牛背杂技”，平时牧童在山上放牛，常", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1424, "w": 1540, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "连环上上下做各种技巧。另一种竞技娱乐被称为“牛背杂技”，平时牧童在山上放牛，常", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1424, "w": 1540, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 21, "text": "在牛背做各种技巧，愉娱同伴。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1489, "w": 543, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在牛背做各种技巧，愉娱同伴。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 1489, "w": 543, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 22, "text": "（六）气功类娱乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1557, "w": 306, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（六）气功类娱乐", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1557, "w": 306, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 23, "text": "包括上刀梯、喉头顶标枪、肚皮上劈石等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1617, "w": 724, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "包括上刀梯、喉头顶标枪、肚皮上劈石等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1617, "w": 724, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 24, "text": "上刀梯。数把刀用竹竿固定成梯，刀刃朝上，表演者赤脚攀登。这种技巧一般由布", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1686, "w": 1455, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "上刀梯。数把刀用竹竿固定成梯，刀刃朝上，表演者赤脚攀登。这种技巧一般由布", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1686, "w": 1455, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 25, "text": "摩用于祭祀仪式，也有民间艺人表演。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1750, "w": 659, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "摩用于祭祀仪式，也有民间艺人表演。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 1750, "w": 659, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 26, "text": "另几种只有少数气功世家掌握，节庆时义务为群众表演，以增加节日娱乐气氛。", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1814, "w": 1375, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "另几种只有少数气功世家掌握，节庆时义务为群众表演，以增加节日娱乐气氛。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1814, "w": 1375, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 27, "text": "（七）信仰类娱乐", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1883, "w": 306, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（七）信仰类娱乐", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1883, "w": 306, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 28, "text": "在黔西南贞丰等地，直至20世纪70年代，仍流行一种“当敬”或“故今”习俗，有很强", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1943, "w": 1463, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "在黔西南贞丰等地，直至20世纪70年代，仍流行一种“当敬”或“故今”习俗，有很强", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 1943, "w": 1463, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 29, "text": "的娱乐性，同时又有信仰因素，使活动笼罩在神秘的氛围中。", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2012, "w": 1045, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "的娱乐性，同时又有信仰因素，使活动笼罩在神秘的氛围中。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2012, "w": 1045, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 30, "text": "在黔西南一带，每年农历七月初到七十五，当夜幕降临，明月升起后，布依族青年男", "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2076, "w": 1459, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "在黔西南一带，每年农历七月初到七十五，当夜幕降临，明月升起后，布依族青年男", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 169, "y": 2076, "w": 1459, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 31, "text": "女都喜欢聚集到一起，进行一种叫做“当敬”（布依语为“dangcjings”）的娱乐活动（也称", "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2136, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "女都喜欢聚集到一起，进行一种叫做“当敬”（布依语为“dangcjings”）的娱乐活动（也称", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 88, "y": 2136, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 32, "text": "“当押敬”（dangcyazjings）或“敬来”（jingslaic）等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2201, "w": 864, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.3, "blocks": [{"text": "“当押敬”（dangcyazjings）或“敬来”（jingslaic）等。", "conf": 0.3, "bbox_px": {"x": 84, "y": 2201, "w": 864, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 414, "line_no": 33, "text": "“当敬”活动情趣盎然，富于戏剧性。角色人数不定，均由一人充当；也没有脚本，全", "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 2259, "w": 1468, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“当敬”活动情趣盎然，富于戏剧性。角色人数不定，均由一人充当；也没有脚本，全", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 165, "y": 2259, "w": 1468, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
